    <briefdescription>
<para>G-Eval evaluator using token probabilities. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements probabilistic scoring where the LLM generates score tokens (1-5) and we extract their probabilities from logits to compute a continuous score: score = Σ(level × P(level))</para>
<para>This provides finer-grained evaluation than discrete rubric levels. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
